# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
SVGS = ['<svg viewBox="0 0 700 260" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="Arial, sans-serif">\n  <rect width="700" height="260" fill="#f8fafc" rx="12"/>\n  <text x="350" y="25" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14" font-weight="bold" fill="#0f172a">ELİF-LÂM (ال) TAKISININ OKUNUŞU: İDGAM-I ŞEMSİYYE VE İZHAR-I KAMERİYYE</text>\n  <rect x="20" y="42" width="320" height="175" rx="10" fill="#fff7ed" stroke="#ea580c" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="180" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#9a3412">1. İDGAM-I ŞEMSİYYE (الشَّمْسِيَّةُ)</text>\n  <text x="32" y="88" font-size="10.6" fill="#7c2d12">• Elif-lâm (ال) takısından sonra 14 Şemsî harften biri</text>\n  <text x="32" y="106" font-size="10.6" fill="#7c2d12">  (ت ث د ذ ر ز س ش ص ض ط ظ ل ن) geldiğinde olur.</text>\n  <text x="32" y="126" font-size="10.6" fill="#7c2d12">• Lâm (ل) harfi okunmaz; sonraki harfe katılarak</text>\n  <text x="32" y="144" font-size="10.6" fill="#7c2d12">  şeddeli okunur (Lâm üzerinde cezim yoktur).</text>\n  <text x="32" y="166" font-size="10.6" font-weight="bold" fill="#9a3412">• Bilâ-Gunne (13 harf): وَالشَّمْسِ، الرَّحْمٰنِ، الدِّينِ</text>\n  <text x="32" y="186" font-size="10.6" font-weight="bold" fill="#9a3412">• Meal-Gunne (Yalnız ن harfi): النَّاسِ، النُّورُ، النَّارِ</text>\n  <rect x="360" y="42" width="320" height="175" rx="10" fill="#eff6ff" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="520" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e40af">2. İZHAR-I KAMERİYYE (الْقَمَرِيَّةُ)</text>\n  <text x="372" y="88" font-size="10.6" fill="#1e3a8a">• Elif-lâm (ال) takısından sonra 14 Kamerî harften biri</text>\n  <text x="372" y="106" font-size="10.6" fill="#1e3a8a">  (ا ب ج ح خ ع غ ف ق ك م و هـ ي) geldiğinde olur.</text>\n  <text x="372" y="126" font-size="10.6" fill="#1e3a8a">• Lâm (لْ) harfi cezimli olarak açıkça ve net okunur;</text>\n  <text x="372" y="144" font-size="10.6" fill="#1e3a8a">  sonraki harfte şedde bulunmaz.</text>\n  <text x="372" y="166" font-size="10.6" font-weight="bold" fill="#1d4ed8">• Kodlama: «إِبْغِ حَجَّكَ وَخَفْ عَقِيمَهُ»</text>\n  <text x="372" y="186" font-size="10.6" font-weight="bold" fill="#1d4ed8">• Örnekler: وَالْقَمَرِ، الْحَمْدُ، الْعَالَمِينَ، الْكِتَابُ</text>\n  <rect x="20" y="224" width="660" height="26" rx="6" fill="#e2e8f0"/>\n  <text x="350" y="241" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.3" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e293b">Pratik Ayırt Etme: Elif-lâm\'dan sonraki harfte şedde varsa İdgam-ı Şemsiyye, Lâm\'da cezim varsa İzhar-ı Kameriyye\'dir.</text>\n</svg>', '<svg viewBox="0 0 700 260" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="Arial, sans-serif">\n  <rect width="700" height="260" fill="#f8fafc" rx="12"/>\n  <text x="350" y="25" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14" font-weight="bold" fill="#0f172a">KALKALE VE LAFZATULLAH (ALLAH LAFZININ OKUNUŞU) KURALLARI</text>\n  <rect x="20" y="42" width="320" height="175" rx="10" fill="#f0fdf4" stroke="#16a34a" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="180" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#166534">KALKALE (الْقَلْقَلَةُ — قُطْبُ جَدٍّ)</text>\n  <text x="32" y="88" font-size="10.6" fill="#14532d">• Kalkale Harfleri (5 harf): ق - ط - ب - ج - د</text>\n  <text x="32" y="108" font-size="10.6" fill="#14532d">• Bu 5 harften biri kelime ortasında veya sonunda</text>\n  <text x="32" y="126" font-size="10.6" fill="#14532d">  sâkin (cezimli veya durak sebebiyle) geldiğinde</text>\n  <text x="32" y="144" font-size="10.6" fill="#14532d">  mahrecin kuvvetlice sarsılıp yankılandırılmasıdır.</text>\n  <text x="32" y="166" font-size="10.6" font-weight="bold" fill="#15803d">• Suğrâ (Ortada): يَقْطَعُونَ، أَفَلَا يَتَدَبَّرُونَ، يَجْعَلْ</text>\n  <text x="32" y="186" font-size="10.6" font-weight="bold" fill="#15803d">• Kübrâ (Vakıfta/Sonda): أَحَدٌ ← أَحَدْ، الْفَلَقْ، مَسَدْ</text>\n  <rect x="360" y="42" width="320" height="175" rx="10" fill="#faf5ff" stroke="#9333ea" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="520" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#6b21a8">LAFZATULLAH (اللّٰه) VE RÂ (ر) HÜKMÜ</text>\n  <text x="372" y="88" font-size="10.6" fill="#581c87">• Lafzatullah\'tan (اللّٰه) önceki harfin harekesi:</text>\n  <text x="380" y="106" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#6b21a8">1) Üstün (ـَ) veya Ötre (ـُ) ise KALIN (Tefhîm):</text>\n  <text x="388" y="123" font-size="10.3" fill="#581c87">هُوَ اللّٰهُ، نَصْرُ اللّٰهِ، عَبْدُ اللّٰهِ، قَالَ اللّٰهُ</text>\n  <text x="380" y="143" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#6b21a8">2) Esre (ـِ) ise İNCE (Terkîk) okunur:</text>\n  <text x="388" y="160" font-size="10.3" fill="#581c87">بِسْمِ اللّٰهِ، لِلّٰهِ، بِاللّٰهِ، فِي سَبِيلِ اللّٰهِ</text>\n  <text x="372" y="184" font-size="10.5" fill="#581c87">• Zamir (هُ): Öncesi harekeliyse uzatılır, sâkinse uzatılmaz.</text>\n  <rect x="20" y="224" width="660" height="26" rx="6" fill="#e2e8f0"/>\n  <text x="350" y="241" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.3" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e293b">İhlâs ve Tebbet surelerinin durak sonları (أَحَدْ، الصَّمَدْ، يَلِدْ، يُولَدْ، لَهَبْ، كَسَبْ، حَطَبْ، مَسَدْ) Kalkale-i Kübrâ örneğidir.</text>\n</svg>', '<svg viewBox="0 0 700 260" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="Arial, sans-serif">\n  <rect width="700" height="260" fill="#f8fafc" rx="12"/>\n  <text x="350" y="25" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14" font-weight="bold" fill="#0f172a">2. TEMA BÜTÜNCÜL ÖZET: TECVİT KURALLARI SINIFLANDIRMA TABLOSU</text>\n  <rect x="20" y="42" width="210" height="175" rx="10" fill="#eff6ff" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="125" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e40af">MED (UZATMA) KURALLARI</text>\n  <text x="30" y="88" font-size="10.3" fill="#1e3a8a">• Medd-i Tabiî (Aslî Med - 1 elif)</text>\n  <text x="30" y="108" font-size="10.3" fill="#1e3a8a">• Medd-i Muttasıl (Bitişik hemze)</text>\n  <text x="30" y="128" font-size="10.3" fill="#1e3a8a">• Medd-i Munfasıl (Ayrı hemze)</text>\n  <text x="30" y="148" font-size="10.3" fill="#1e3a8a">• Medd-i Lâzım (Lâzımî sükûn)</text>\n  <text x="30" y="168" font-size="10.3" fill="#1e3a8a">• Medd-i Ârız (Durak sükûnu)</text>\n  <text x="30" y="188" font-size="10.3" fill="#1e3a8a">• Medd-i Lîn (وْ / يْ + sükûn)</text>\n  <rect x="245" y="42" width="210" height="175" rx="10" fill="#f0fdf4" stroke="#16a34a" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="350" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#166534">TENVİN, NÛN VE MÎM</text>\n  <text x="255" y="88" font-size="10.3" fill="#14532d">• İzhar (ء هـ ع ح غ خ)</text>\n  <text x="255" y="108" font-size="10.3" fill="#14532d">• İhfa (15 harf — gunneli gizleme)</text>\n  <text x="255" y="128" font-size="10.3" fill="#14532d">• İklab (ب harfi — mîm\'e çevirme)</text>\n  <text x="255" y="148" font-size="10.3" fill="#14532d">• İdgam-ı Meal-Gunne (ي م ن و)</text>\n  <text x="255" y="168" font-size="10.3" fill="#14532d">• İdgam-ı Bilâ-Gunne (ل ر)</text>\n  <text x="255" y="188" font-size="10.3" fill="#14532d">• Sâkin Mîm: Şefevî İhfa/İdgam/İzhar</text>\n  <rect x="470" y="42" width="210" height="175" rx="10" fill="#fef3c7" stroke="#d97706" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="575" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#92400e">DİĞER İDGAM VE ÖZEL KURALLAR</text>\n  <text x="480" y="88" font-size="10.3" fill="#78350f">• İdgam-ı Misleyn (Aynı harf)</text>\n  <text x="480" y="108" font-size="10.3" fill="#78350f">• İdgam-ı Mütecaniseyn (ط د ت / ظ ذ ث)</text>\n  <text x="480" y="128" font-size="10.3" fill="#78350f">• İdgam-ı Mütekaribeyn (ل ر / ق ك)</text>\n  <text x="480" y="148" font-size="10.3" fill="#78350f">• İdgam-ı Şemsiyye &amp; İzhar-ı Kameriyye</text>\n  <text x="480" y="168" font-size="10.3" fill="#78350f">• Kalkale (ق ط ب ج د)</text>\n  <text x="480" y="188" font-size="10.3" fill="#78350f">• Lafzatullah &amp; Hükmü\'r-Râ</text>\n  <rect x="20" y="224" width="660" height="26" rx="6" fill="#e2e8f0"/>\n  <text x="350" y="241" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.3" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e293b">Kur\'an-ı Kerim\'i tertîl ve tecvit kurallarına riayet ederek okumak hem anlamı korur hem de tilaveti güzelleştirir.</text>\n</svg>']

def uygula(v):
    for i, b in enumerate(v.get("bolumler", [])):
        if i < len(SVGS):
            b["gorsel"] = SVGS[i]
